{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":56}},"slideshow_D3giif":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"slide_FcyPm8":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ST-04_2800x1000_crop_center_b49543d7-542e-4820-a472-a77427be47e7.webp","heading":"mad lords","heading_size":"h0","subheading":"","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"box_align":"middle-center","show_text_box":false,"text_alignment":"center","image_overlay_opacity":60,"color_scheme":"accent-1","text_alignment_mobile":"center"}}},"block_order":["slide_FcyPm8"],"custom_css":[".slideshow__text.banner__box.content-container.content-container--full-width-mobile.color-accent-1.gradient.slideshow__text--center.slideshow__text-mobile--center {background: transparent !important;}"],"settings":{"layout":"full_bleed","slide_height":"small","slider_visual":"counter","auto_rotate":false,"change_slides_speed":5,"image_behavior":"none","show_text_below":false,"accessibility_info":"Slideshow about our brand"}},"rich_text_wq3Dd7":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_FjhjbJ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"about mad lords","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_VB7Uzj":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Text about mad lords here.........<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_FjhjbJ","text_VB7Uzj"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"rich_text_8BrJcP":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_76UJ9i":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"find shamballa at these locations","heading_size":"h2"}}},"block_order":["heading_76UJ9i"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0}},"image_with_text_JJ7jJT":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_a64NDb":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Paris, France","text_style":"subtitle","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_6ppfAQ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"mad lords","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_deWkFV":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>The Mad Lords boutique in Paris is a hidden gem, inviting visitors on a journey. Blending 19th-century jewelry charm with the vibe of a music studio and library, it offers a unique, intimate experience.<\/p><p>Elegant displays and dark wood shelves create a creative atmosphere, showcasing Mad Lords' latest discoveries. Each piece tells its own story, merging luxury and craftsmanship in a magical space that embodies elegance and creativity.<\/p><p><strong>Opening hours:<br\/><\/strong>Monday – Saturday: 10:30 - 19.00<br\/>Sunday: Closed<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/MAD+LORDS+Piercing+Studio\/@48.8652879,2.3289582,17z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m17!1m10!3m9!1s0x54906ab4d1cb202d:0x25ad4ed29e831c9a!2sTWIST!8m2!3d47.6621831!4d-122.2996438!10e5!14m1!1BCgIYEg!16s%2Fg%2F1td71q0h!3m5!1s0x47e66e2e6a83a897:0x7dc3ce5cda6b5cd8!8m2!3d48.8652844!4d2.3315331!16s%2Fg%2F1pzylswcj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mad Lords Paris\">316 & 320 rue Saint-Honoré, <br\/>75001 Paris, France<\/a><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_a64NDb","heading_6ppfAQ","text_deWkFV"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/316-01-DESKTOP_2800x1000_crop_center_4c7966fc-6565-4329-83d7-7fdcb2b27cfd.webp","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"large","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_GbXGFA":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_mXR6k8":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Saint-Tropez, France","text_style":"subtitle","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_4V6JYz":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"mad lords","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_bTQPNW":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>In the heart of Saint-Tropez, Mad Lords is a sanctuary of hippie-chic style, offering a bohemian yet refined atmosphere and an exclusive selection of high-end jewelry. Each piece is carefully chosen for elegance and originality, making this boutique a must-visit for luxury and fashion lovers.<\/p><p>Every piece tells a story, immersing clients in a timeless, sensory journey into hippie-chic luxury<\/p><p><strong>Opening hours:<\/strong><br\/>Monday – Sunday: 10.30 - 22.00<br\/><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/MAD+LORDS+Saint-Tropez\/@43.2718949,6.6373091,17z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x12cec7db970c5fb1:0x815539f79eb3de62!8m2!3d43.271891!4d6.639884!16s%2Fg%2F11rycpxwkd?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mad Lords Saint-Tropez\">10 rue Gambetta,<br\/>83990 Saint-Tropez, France<\/a><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_mXR6k8","heading_4V6JYz","text_bTQPNW"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ST-05_2800x1000_crop_center_5e9961b1-6ea7-4814-8817-b992b0d04e32.webp","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"large","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_4PLdgk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_mdzDEQ":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Deauville, France","text_style":"subtitle","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_bHExjn":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"mad lords","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_dbzFwY":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Mad Lords in Deauville, located in the prestigious Golden Triangle opposite the iconic Drakkar brasserie, captures the spirit of this vibrant seaside town. <\/p><p>The jewelry collection balances tradition with modernity, blending local values with avant-garde elements that surprise without alienating. This bold yet respectful approach allows Mad Lords to thrive in Deauville, attracting clients seeking authenticity and innovation.<\/p><p><strong>Opening hours:<\/strong><br\/>Monday – Saturday: 10.30 - 19.00<br\/>Sunday: 14:30 - 18.00<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/place\/MAD+LORDS+Deauville\/@49.3596073,0.0730345,17z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47e1d5dd92f2a20b:0xf66c5cd2f8048f3d!8m2!3d49.3596073!4d0.0730345!16s%2Fg%2F11ll280zp5?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mad Lords Deauville\">92 rue Eugène Colas, <br\/>14800 Deauville, France<\/a><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_mdzDEQ","heading_bHExjn","text_dbzFwY"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/D_PAGE_1_2800x1000_crop_center_71d2e0fa-b3fe-4645-9830-42b7f91a9949.webp","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"large","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","